reject \[zpwg7\] baton: no target
reject \[zpwg7\] (error|unknown subcommand)
reject ^(?!.*RuntimeDistCleaner).*(Exception|/ERROR\]).*(powergrid|patryk)
look slowness at 2000 (output 0.25) and 0 is none (effect clear ran after the 20000 and 8000 hits); villager type and max health: record (MCA may differ); no slowness at full charge: BatteryUtils.drawEnergy or the max health

