sleep 2
> zpwg7 pbat 1100 -60 1530
sleep 4
> zpwg7 pbat 1104 -60 1530
sleep 4
> zpwg7 pbat 1100 -60 1530
> zpwg7 pick 1100 -60 1530
> zpwg7 hold minecraft:iron_pickaxe
> zpwg7 dig 1100 -60 1530
sleep 1
> zpwg7 drops 1100 -60 1530 2
expect \[zpwg7\] place powergrid:portable_battery result=(SUCCESS|CONSUME) block=powergrid:portable_battery heldNow=\S+x0
expect \[zpwg7\] pbat charge=0 capacityLevel=0 comparator=0
expect \[zpwg7\] pbat charge=([4-9]\d{3}|1\d{4}) capacityLevel=0
expect \[zpwg7\] pbat charge=20000 capacityLevel=0 comparator=15 clone=powergrid:portable_battery cloneCharge=20000
expect \[zpwg7\] pbat terminals T0=
expect \[zpwg7\] pbat charge=30000 capacityLevel=1
expect \[zpwg7\] pbat charge=40000 capacityLevel=1 comparator=15
expect \[zpwg7\] pick result=PASS block=powergrid:portable_battery
expect \[zpwg7\] dig result=true after=minecraft:air
expect \[zpwg7\] drop powergrid:portable_battery x1 Charge=20000 capacityLevel=0
reject \[zpwg7\] pbat none at
reject \[zpwg\w*\] (error|unknown subcommand)
reject ^(?!.*RuntimeDistCleaner).*(Exception|/ERROR\]).*(powergrid|patryk)
look waits overlap: the first block's mid read is about 9 s (~180 ticks) after wiring, its last about 18 s; the Capacity block's second read about 8 s after wiring; record the mid charge and convert to FE per tick (row: about 80 at 40 V); no overheat; comparator = charge / max x 15

